ot Found\\\". localStorage is empty and there is no persistence API (fetch /api/products returns the SPA index.html), so all admin data lives only in memory.\", \"evidence\": \"Post-reload: products.count=\\\"9 products found\\\", body contains \\\"QA Aeropress\\\" = false, Object.keys(localStorage) = [].\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Admin category control is a single-select restricted to exactly Tech Gadgets / Home Goods / Fitness (no blank or \\\"other\\\" option, and it defaults to Tech Gadgets). All 10 products (9 seeded + 1 created) render exactly one category badge each on the grid and one category on their detail page: 3 Tech, 4 Home, 3 Fitness — totals matching the per-category pages (3/4/3 = 10).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tags espresso+headphones → 2 results (Breville, Sony), each carrying one of the selected tags (OR within tags). Adding category=Tech narrowed to 1 (Sony). Adding search \\\"espresso\\\" on top → 0 products found + empty state, confirming AND across search/category/tag. Earlier: rating≥4.5 + price≤$2410 → 7 results all satisfying both.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Publish validation only enforces name + short description; image, retailer link, review and specifications are not required\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the admin form with only Product Name (\\\"QA Minimal Product\\\") and Short Description filled produced \\\"Product created successfully\\\". The product is live at /product/qa-minimal-product with price $0, empty image src (\\\"\\\"), empty \\\"Buy Now\\\" href (\\\"\\\"), an empty \\\"My Review\\\" section and an empty \\\"Key Specifications\\\" section (0 spec rows). Only a fully empty form is rejected (\\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\").\", \"evidence\": \"Detail page: buy href=\\\"\\\", img src=\\\"\\\", specs count=0, review=\\\"\\\